    {
      "id": "economy-dashboard",
      "payload": {
        "title": "[小猫回家记][业务-经营] 支付与经济",
        "description": "#18 业务观测 · preview · [managed-by:stray-kitty-biz-obs;definition:economy-dashboard]\n由 monitors/business-observability.json 维护；变更需同步代码。",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "note",
              "content": "支付曝光/点击归模块二前端 RUM 看板；此处从后端 session_created 开始。经济 delta 是变动次数，amount 是实际货币数量；金额比必须用 amount。未建立健康基线前，支付转化/经济漂移只展示趋势，不部署占位阈值告警。会话日志可检索，尚不是经过去重及 cohort 对齐的留存率。",
              "background_color": "white",
              "font_size": "14",
              "text_align": "left",
              "has_padding": true
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "支付漏斗各步次数",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "name": "a",
                      "query": "sum:kitty.payment.funnel{service:kitty-api,env:preview,!qa:true} by {step}.as_count()",
